# Raw ERA5 chunks for the D-049 test. Large, reproducible from
# pull_night_minima.py, and never committed. The committed artifact is the
# derived series, not the source grids. Same policy as crops/.cache/.
.cache/

# Per-run builder status, written every run by the assembled-city builders
# and read by the check that asks whether anything moved. Ephemeral by
# design: it describes THIS run, and committing it would dirty the tree on
# every build in a repo nine chats share.
data/status/
